  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44245904",
      "title": "Handling Form Submission",
      "sourceHash": "79757949c1b14bc608f1e9b831f63632ae943ca97b03f2d865ce02e6289364b0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.07,
          "end": 5.43,
          "en": "So let's handle this form's submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.43,
          "end": 8.373,
          "en": "with this form actions feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 12.51,
          "en": "And for that we should go to the new opinion component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.51,
          "end": 17.04,
          "en": "because it's that component that contains this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.04,
          "end": 19.68,
          "en": "And in there we can, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.68,
          "end": 23.28,
          "en": "now add a new form action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.28,
          "end": 28.28,
          "en": "And this is now actually also a great exercise for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 28.77,
          "end": 30.54,
          "en": "because before we dive deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.54,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "and turn this into an async function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "and send an HTTP request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 38.52,
          "en": "I want you to handle the submission of this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.52,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "and this component with help of a form action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 45.09,
          "en": "as you learned it over the last couple of lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.09,
          "end": 49.62,
          "en": "So you should also validate the input in any way you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.62,
          "end": 52.08,
          "en": "Doesn't matter, I'll show you my way soon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.08,
          "end": 55.193,
          "en": "but you can validate it in any way you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.193,
          "end": 57.72,
          "en": "And then show some error messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.72,
          "end": 60.84,
          "en": "if invalid values have been entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.84,
          "end": 63.18,
          "en": "But also make sure that the form is cleared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.18,
          "end": 67.02,
          "en": "if it has been submitted with valid values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 69.63,
          "en": "And at the moment, you don't need to do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 73.28999999999999,
          "en": "with the entered values, just use them for validation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.28999999999999,
          "end": 74.31,
          "en": "nothing else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.31,
          "end": 78.056,
          "en": "We'll connect this form to the backend together soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.056,
          "end": 81.12,
          "en": "But to practice what you learned, handle the submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.12,
          "end": 84.93,
          "en": "with help of use action state and by adding validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.93,
          "end": 88.74,
          "en": "Here's a short pause for you to pause the video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.74,
          "end": 91.35300000000001,
          "en": "Thereafter, we'll implement this together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.3,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "And we could define this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "outside of the component function as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "but soon I'll use a feature in that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 108.18,
          "en": "that requires it to be inside of the component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.18,
          "end": 111.84,
          "en": "And that's why I'll define it in that component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.84,
          "end": 113.58,
          "en": "right from the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.58,
          "end": 115.83,
          "en": "So it's again, a new function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.83,
          "end": 120.83,
          "en": "a share opinion action function, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 123.093,
          "en": "Obviously the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.02,
          "end": 126.99,
          "en": "And as you learned, we get a form data object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.99,
          "end": 130.71,
          "en": "at least if we now use this function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.71,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "for the action prop of this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 135.39,
          "en": "which is what I'm doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 138.39,
          "en": "So now this function will be called by React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 140.343,
          "en": "when that form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.5,
          "end": 145.68,
          "en": "And in here we can then extract the entered values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 148.26,
          "en": "like the username, the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.26,
          "end": 152.673,
          "en": "and the body of this opinion that is being shared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.07999999999998,
          "end": 158.963,
          "en": "So here I got my title with help of formData get title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "I got the body, so the text that, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.16,
          "end": 168.3,
          "en": "contains the opinion from the body input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.3,
          "end": 169.713,
          "en": "which is a text area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 176.03,
          "en": "And then I got the username from formData get username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.04,
          "end": 177.75,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.75,
          "end": 182.75,
          "en": "Now of course we might want to validate that user input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 186.42,
          "en": "and therefore I'll do it in the same way as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.42,
          "end": 189.9,
          "en": "I'll add an errors array and then add a couple of if checks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 193.41,
          "en": "and check if the title, after trimming it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 196.95,
          "en": "to remove access white space at the beginning and end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 200.523,
          "en": "if it has a length smaller than five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.36,
          "end": 204.06,
          "en": "So if it has less than five characters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 204.06,
          "end": 207.09,
          "en": "In that case, I want to push an error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.09,
          "end": 209.917,
          "en": "onto this errors array, and that should be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 209.917,
          "end": 214.917,
          "en": "\"Title must be at least five characters long.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 217.07999999999998,
          "end": 220.59,
          "en": "Now my second check is for the body, which I also trim,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.59,
          "end": 223.35,
          "en": "if that has a length smaller than 10,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 223.35,
          "end": 228.35,
          "en": "or if, after trimming it, it has a length greater than 300.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 229.32,
          "end": 232.71,
          "en": "In that case, I want to add an error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 232.71,
          "end": 237.15,
          "en": "and say, \"Opinion must be between 10",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 237.15,
          "end": 241.017,
          "en": "and 300 characters long.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 242.49,
          "end": 245.91,
          "en": "And last but not least, for the username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 245.91,
          "end": 250.673,
          "en": "I just wanna check if, after trimming it, it's falsy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 255,
          "en": "So if it's an empty string after trimming it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 255,
          "end": 257.46,
          "en": "So after removing excess white space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 257.46,
          "end": 258.9,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 258.9,
          "end": 261.39,
          "en": "if the user did not provide a username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 261.39,
          "end": 264.96,
          "en": "I'll say, \"Please provide your name.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 264.96,
          "end": 265.793,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 267.27,
          "end": 271.41,
          "en": "Now, just as before, I then wanna check if errors length",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 271.41,
          "end": 273.12,
          "en": "is greater zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 273.12,
          "end": 274.89300000000003,
          "en": "So if I have errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 276.18,
          "end": 281.18,
          "en": "And in that case I wanna return an object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 281.22,
          "end": 283.74,
          "en": "which we then will soon handle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 283.74,
          "end": 286.5,
          "en": "with help of use action state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 286.5,
          "end": 290.775,
          "en": "an object where my errors are stored in an errors key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 290.775,
          "end": 293.31,
          "en": "using the shortcut here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.31,
          "end": 296.85,
          "en": "But of course I wanna make sure that the entered values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.85,
          "end": 300.27,
          "en": "so the values entered by the user, aren't lost.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 300.27,
          "end": 304.53,
          "en": "So just as before, I'll add this entered values key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 304.53,
          "end": 306.81,
          "en": "and store a nested object in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 306.81,
          "end": 310.44,
          "en": "where I then store all the entered values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.44,
          "end": 312.75,
          "en": "So the title, the body, and the username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 312.75,
          "end": 315.27,
          "en": "so that we can then use these values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.27,
          "end": 317.49,
          "en": "with help of use action state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 317.49,
          "end": 321.12,
          "en": "to repopulate these form inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.12,
          "end": 323.01,
          "en": "Now if you make it past this if check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.01,
          "end": 325.05,
          "en": "I know that we have a valid form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 330.05,
          "en": "and in that case I wanna submit those values to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 330.631,
          "end": 333.243,
          "en": "We'll do that in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.98,
          "end": 338.76,
          "en": "But I also wanna clear the form now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 338.76,
          "end": 341.19,
          "en": "So I'll return a new form state object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.19,
          "end": 343.743,
          "en": "where errors is set to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.61,
          "end": 349.61,
          "en": "And with that, we can now add the useActionState hook here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 349.83,
          "end": 351.39300000000003,
          "en": "to this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 352.53,
          "end": 356.98,
          "en": "So import useActionState from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 358.40999999999997,
          "end": 361.26,
          "en": "and use that with that form action here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.26,
          "end": 365.373,
          "en": "to handle the state that's managed by that action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 366.24,
          "end": 369.66,
          "en": "So call useActionState here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 369.66,
          "end": 372.57,
          "en": "pass the shareOpinionAction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 372.57,
          "end": 375.063,
          "en": "as a first input value to that hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 376.2,
          "end": 379.14,
          "en": "And as a second input value, the initial state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 379.14,
          "end": 382.89,
          "en": "where errors is set to null, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 382.89,
          "end": 387.663,
          "en": "And then I get back these two main values I'm interested in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 387.663,
          "end": 391.34,
          "en": "So I get back the formState and the formAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 392.34000000000003,
          "end": 395.76,
          "en": "and it's now the formAction that should be set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 395.76,
          "end": 397.743,
          "en": "for this action prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 399.45,
          "end": 403.47,
          "en": "And as you learned, once you start using useActionState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 403.47,
          "end": 407.88,
          "en": "your action function will be called slightly differently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 407.88,
          "end": 410.90999999999997,
          "en": "and it will no longer receive this formData object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 410.90999999999997,
          "end": 414.181,
          "en": "as the first and only input parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 414.181,
          "end": 416.4,
          "en": "Instead, this formData object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 416.4,
          "end": 418.77,
          "en": "will now be the second input parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 418.77,
          "end": 423.153,
          "en": "and the first parameter will be the previous formState.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 424.38,
          "end": 426.78,
          "en": "So that adjustment must be made here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 426.78,
          "end": 429.99,
          "en": "even though I'm not using that previous state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 429.99,
          "end": 431.46,
          "en": "but we must accept it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 431.46,
          "end": 434.553,
          "en": "and accept form data as the second parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 435.75,
          "end": 438.45,
          "en": "With that, we can then use the formState here to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 438.45,
          "end": 440.58299999999997,
          "en": "for example, output errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 441.63,
          "end": 445.35,
          "en": "So here, above my button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 445.35,
          "end": 448.863,
          "en": "I'll check if formState errors is truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 449.73,
          "end": 453.21,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I'll output an unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 453.21,
          "end": 456.6,
          "en": "with a class name of errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 456.6,
          "end": 459.423,
          "en": "And now it is errors, not error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 460.35,
          "end": 464.79,
          "en": "where I then go through my errors like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 464.79,
          "end": 465.993,
